**IV. Upstream Acknowledgements**
This skill was developed with reference to the technical ideas and
visual design conventions of the following two MIT-licensed open
source projects:

  1) archify by @tt-a1i (MIT License)
     https://github.com/tt-a1i/archify
     Inspiration: interactive viewer and orthogonal non-crossing routing
     of the visual concept.

  2) fireworks-tech-graph by @yizhiyanhua-ai (MIT License)
     https://github.com/yizhiyanhua-ai/fireworks-tech-graph
     Inspiration: style layering, AI/Agent pattern semantics, and the
     UML subset diagram taxonomy.

All code, color palettes, documentation and branding in this skill are
independently written by Baiying AI Studio. No specific code or branding
was copied from the upstream projects. Any redistribution or derivative
work must preserve both the "Baiying AI Studio" attribution and the
